        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cankton%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Dr. Cank’s original office, still standing on Main Street beside his home, remains a landmark of the village.",
